{"data": [{"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:37:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115845608796021094"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/d2p1IPiZvn", "end": 268, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2115845608796021094/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115845521722232835", "start": 245, "url": "https://t.co/d2p1IPiZvn"}]}, "id": "2115845608796021094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 6452, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "A couple of random observations about the US GDP data --\n\none is that service consumption growth seems to have increased relative to goods consumption growth in the post pandemic years (helps with GDP, less imported content in services).  \n\n1/2 https://t.co/d2p1IPiZvn", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2115845608796021094"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:28:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115843263265685559"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/econberger/sta…", "end": 191, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/econberger/status/2115833176220475447", "start": 168, "url": "https://t.co/rdwWXiag6X"}]}, "id": "2115843263265685559", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1436, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115833176220475447", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "It speaks highly of economist academia that a lot of experts who are critical of the research being slop-audited were nevertheless even more critical of the slop-audit https://t.co/rdwWXiag6X", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115843263265685559"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:03:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115837047386886496"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jasonfurman/st…", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jasonfurman/status/2115814704241344965", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/iCkx2JHBc4"}]}, "id": "2115837047386886496", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4189, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115814704241344965", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "And q1 25 was tariff front running (pharma especially)\n\nTho to be fair to q3 6, the large swing in net exports was in part a normalization after of some of the after effects of front running faded.  But it was mostly a real surge in capital goods imports for data centers https://t.co/iCkx2JHBc4", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2115837047386886496"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:52:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115834119175409708"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/conorsen/statu…", "end": 61, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/conorsen/status/2115833927009280108", "start": 38, "url": "https://t.co/v6s66OLIhR"}]}, "id": "2115834119175409708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 90111, "like_count": 1150, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 26}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115833927009280108", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "They're selling dollars for 50 cents! https://t.co/v6s66OLIhR", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115834119175409708"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:48:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115833176220475447"], "id": "2115833176220475447", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2862, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My general take on yesterday’s “AI slop-audit of an econ paper” discourse is that AI is capable of very high quality reviews but in reality we’re going to be inundated with low quality slop reviews", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115833176220475447"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:45:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115832503852568881"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 126, "start": 115, "tag": "IMPACT2026"}], "mentions": [{"end": 36, "id": "18036280", "start": 27, "username": "timsteno"}, {"end": 53, "id": "160948300", "start": 41, "username": "carolmassar"}, {"end": 72, "id": "57675435", "start": 57, "username": "BloombergRadio"}]}, "id": "2115832503852568881", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12397, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Looking forward to joining @timsteno and @carolmassar on @BloombergRadio around 4:20pm ET today live from Schwab’s #IMPACT2026 conference", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115832503852568881"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:40:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115831097049116710"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 31, "id": "53348301", "start": 19, "username": "PEWilliams_"}, {"end": 225, "id": "1826103617310367744", "start": 214, "username": "neslusajme"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LLYpVzX0vc", "end": 251, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115831097049116710/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115830931743240192", "start": 228, "url": "https://t.co/LLYpVzX0vc"}]}, "id": "2115831097049116710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 14331, "like_count": 154, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "I was stunned when @PEWilliams_ busted out the harmonica last night, because normally he forgets it. Also man, Lucinda's really does have the best lighting of any bar we've played in. All the photos look cool (via @neslusajme ) https://t.co/LLYpVzX0vc", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115831097049116710"}, {"author_id": "733647469305864195", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115822641949069669"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UTi8SAC6L7", "end": 196, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2115822641949069669/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115822587456692224", "start": 173, "url": "https://t.co/UTi8SAC6L7"}]}, "id": "2115822641949069669", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 6611, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Guess it is a bit ironic that an Administration opposed to trade (and imports) is presiding over one of the more rapid increases in (real) imports in recent history ...\n\n1/ https://t.co/UTi8SAC6L7", "url": "https://x.com/Brad_Setser/status/2115822641949069669"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T14:39:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115815793980285072"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6BzISac4Os", "end": 74, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115815793980285072/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115815788200202240", "start": 51, "url": "https://t.co/6BzISac4Os"}]}, "id": "2115815793980285072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 39479, "like_count": 172, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "OpenAI's implied marketcap trading on HyperLiquid. https://t.co/6BzISac4Os", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115815793980285072"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115798447156506986"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 155, "start": 144, "tag": "IMPACT2026"}], "mentions": [{"end": 42, "id": "898301664", "start": 27, "username": "michaelsantoli"}, {"end": 57, "id": "39879120", "start": 47, "username": "SaraEisen"}, {"end": 66, "id": "20402945", "start": 61, "username": "CNBC"}, {"end": 80, "id": "106498703", "start": 67, "username": "SquawkStreet"}]}, "id": "2115798447156506986", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14021, "like_count": 19, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Looking forward to joining @michaelsantoli and @SaraEisen on @CNBC @SquawkStreet around 11am ET this morning … where I’ll be live from Schwab’s #IMPACT2026 conference in Boston", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115798447156506986"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:28:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115798012706639936"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 92, "start": 82, "tag": "inflation"}], "mentions": [{"end": 141, "id": "144274618", "start": 131, "username": "economics"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ygKvqmFi0K", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115798012706639936/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115798008675663872", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/ygKvqmFi0K"}]}, "id": "2115798012706639936", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 11041, "like_count": 56, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 18, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "AI-driven inflation eased in September, contributing just 0.82bps to headline PCE #inflation, down from December’s peak of 4.60bps @economics https://t.co/ygKvqmFi0K", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115798012706639936"}, {"author_id": "702235316812275712", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:20:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795819454718348"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 66, "id": "2323172244", "start": 58, "username": "tmahedy"}], "urls": [{"description": "My raw, unfiltered, GIF-filled, salty hot take on what happened at today’s press conference. Sensibilities beware.", "display_url": "accessmacro.substack.com/p/way-too-earl…", "end": 92, "expanded_url": "https://accessmacro.substack.com/p/way-too-early-takes-on-the-october?r=2wn1yx&utm_campaign=post&utm_medium=web", "images": [{"height": 800, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115795820008370176/Xa-CF8nm?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1600}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115795820008370176/Xa-CF8nm?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 69, "status": 200, "title": "Way Too Early Takes on the October FOMC Meeting", "unwound_url": "https://accessmacro.substack.com/p/way-too-early-takes-on-the-october?r=2wn1yx&utm_campaign=post&utm_medium=web", "url": "https://t.co/VvsBxGvoI9"}]}, "id": "2115795819454718348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1247, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "GIF-infused FOMC hot takes from my Access/Macro colleague @tmahedy \n\nhttps://t.co/VvsBxGvoI9", "url": "https://x.com/EconBerger/status/2115795819454718348"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:18:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115795355233362199"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/x4PBQWp4JV", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115795355233362199/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115795347813421056", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/x4PBQWp4JV"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/x4PBQWp4JV", "end": 282, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115795355233362199/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115795347838562304", "start": 259, "url": "https://t.co/x4PBQWp4JV"}]}, "id": "2115795355233362199", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 11030, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Initial jobless claims up to 194k vs. 198k est. &amp; 195k prior; continuing claims at 1.701M vs. 1.720M est. &amp; 1.722M prior … greatest increases in  NY (+2.9k), CA (+1.4k), &amp; TX (+1.3k); greatest decreases in MI (-1.8k), TN (-1.0k), &amp; KY (-0.5k) https://t.co/x4PBQWp4JV", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115795355233362199"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:59:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115790610125013125"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 76, "id": "1622260212798291972", "start": 61, "username": "chameleon_jeff"}], "urls": [{"description": "Podcast Episode · Odd Lots · October 15 · 58m", "display_url": "podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/jef…", "end": 100, "expanded_url": "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/jeff-yans-plan-to-bring-the-entire-financial-industry/id1056200096?i=1000796459553", "images": [{"height": 1200, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115790615321714688/tHzVKQCj?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115790615321714688/tHzVKQCj?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 77, "status": 200, "title": "Jeff Yan's Plan to Bring the Entire Financial Industry Onto Hyperliquid", "unwound_url": "https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/jeff-yans-plan-to-bring-the-entire-financial-industry/id1056200096?i=1000796459553", "url": "https://t.co/RuIhGZPJPP"}]}, "id": "2115790610125013125", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 15329, "like_count": 212, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "May be a good time to go back and listen to our episode with @chameleon_jeff https://t.co/RuIhGZPJPP", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2115790610125013125"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:55:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115789639919579526"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/auSPes7sP1", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789639919579526/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115789635938844673", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/auSPes7sP1"}]}, "id": "2115789639919579526", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 11382, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 27, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "GDP’s components … another strong Q for capex (nonresidential fixed investment), but continues to be somewhat offset by a drag from net exports (AI buildout is very import-driven, which doesn’t accrue to benefit of GDP … remember the D stands for domestic) https://t.co/auSPes7sP1", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789639919579526"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:53:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115789065286979756"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0k64alk0aa", "end": 167, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789065286979756/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115789058525765633", "start": 144, "url": "https://t.co/0k64alk0aa"}]}, "id": "2115789065286979756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 11671, "like_count": 61, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 23, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Advance estimate for 3Q2026 GDP +3.4% (q/q ann.) vs. +3.2% est. &amp; +2.2% prior … personal consumption +3.8% vs. +3.4% est. &amp; +3.8% prior https://t.co/0k64alk0aa", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115789065286979756"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:52:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115788904326652186"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/p65HzjXdBv", "end": 193, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788904326652186/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115788899972710400", "start": 170, "url": "https://t.co/p65HzjXdBv"}]}, "id": "2115788904326652186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 10214, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "September personal income +0.2% m/m vs. +0.3% est. &amp; +0.3% prior … personal spending +0.5% vs. +0.6% est. &amp; +0.9% prior (another month with spending &gt; income) https://t.co/p65HzjXdBv", "url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788904326652186"}, {"author_id": "2961589380", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:51:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115788655411515744"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 24, "start": 14, "tag": "inflation"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3HwYLdK9qU", "end": 157, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LizAnnSonders/status/2115788655411515744/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115788650801676288", "start": 134, "url": "https://t.co/3H